From: MikolajQ <mikolaj.q@wp.pl>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:16:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] sm6225-common: Include system.prop in the build

"Silence spammy log tags" added persist.log.tag.slpi=S and
persist.log.tag.RBS=S to system.prop, but nothing adds that file to
TARGET_SYSTEM_PROP: the build only picks up system.prop from
TARGET_DEVICE_DIR (device/motorola/rhode), so the properties never
reached the device (checked on rhode 13.10.2026: no persist.log.tag.*
set, the sensors HAL still logs every ALS/proximity sample under the
"slpi" tag).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dr8X39PngEfThUaxTxyj9B
---
 BoardConfigCommon.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/BoardConfigCommon.mk b/BoardConfigCommon.mk
index d6bf6d0..5280cce 100644
--- a/BoardConfigCommon.mk
+++ b/BoardConfigCommon.mk
@@ -147,6 +147,7 @@ TARGET_USES_INTERACTION_BOOST := true
 # Properties
 TARGET_ODM_PROP += $(COMMON_PATH)/odm.prop
 TARGET_PRODUCT_PROP += $(COMMON_PATH)/product.prop
+TARGET_SYSTEM_PROP += $(COMMON_PATH)/system.prop
 TARGET_SYSTEM_EXT_PROP += $(COMMON_PATH)/system_ext.prop
 TARGET_VENDOR_PROP += $(COMMON_PATH)/vendor.prop
 
